  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: new #[tokio::test] all_team_projection_aggregates_each_roster_through_the_async_loop in doctor_projection.rs seeds two team rosters via an isolated SQLite boundary, runs StorageDoctorProjection::project with all_teams: true against a CountingEndpoint HerdrEndpointDoctor fake, and asserts report.team_rosters.len() == 2 and exactly 2 Herdr calls -- directly exercising the daemon-side per-team aggregation loop. Personally-run cargo test -p atm-runtime confirmed this test passes (29 tests green) at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
